outcome proved by the bundle.\n\nWhy no escalation and no referral: the trace is not impaired under POL-RD-07 (195 fixes at a 10-second cadence, no gaps, largest straight-line step 216.7 m, highest implied speed 78.0 km/h). The POL-RD-06 profile check comes back clean (deviation_flags_90d 0 against completed_trips_90d 330) and the excess is not material (6.37 km is below the 8.0 km limb and 44.86% below the 50% limb), so no conduct referral arises. The traffic-advisory slot is empty (EV-ADVIS-04005-01 is MISSING, weight 0.0, issue MISSING_ARTIFACT), but no party asserts an external traffic cause, so POL-RD-03 is not invoked and POL-RD-10(5) is not engaged.\n\nConfidence: 0.9. The cap is 1.0 - the deciding facts (the rider instruction and the unbilled kilometre shortfall) rest on EV-CHAT-04005, EV-GPS-04005 and EV-FARE-04005, each at weight_multiplier 1.0. The monetary effect of SGD 4.80 does not exceed the execution threshold of SGD 8.00, so it executes automatically unless appealed (POL-GEN-04, POL-GEN-05)."
